CompileFlags:
  CompilationDatabase: out/build/gcc-debug

Diagnostics:
  ClangTidy:
    Add:
      - bugprone-*
      - modernize-*
      - performance-*
      - readability-*
    Remove:
      - modernize-use-trailing-return-type

Index:
  Background: Build

InlayHints:
  Enabled: Yes
  ParameterNames: Yes
  DeducedTypes: Yes